      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0010",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "When using the [`GKRandomDistribution`](gkrandomdistribution.md) class directly, generated numbers are uniform within the range of the distribution.",
      "normalizedSource": "When using the [`GKRandomDistribution`](gkrandomdistribution.md) class directly, generated numbers are uniform within the range of the distribution.",
